[{"id":1779462701532,"text":"离婚那段时间……整晚整晚睡不着的时候，会抽。","rawContent":"离婚那段时间……整晚整晚睡不着的时候，会抽。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"上午12:12","timestamp":1779466353409,"roundId":"round_1779466323088_8esnwonus","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775571541656_v84y814wp","characterId":"d8a326fa-9988-447d-8d82-e4e5a4ece511","_id":25447},{"id":1779462701533,"text":"后来就戒了。那个打火机估计是不知道什么时候随手塞在里面的，我都忘了。","rawContent":"后来就戒了。那个打火机估计是不知道什么时候随手塞在里面的，我都忘了。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"上午12:12","timestamp":1779466357914,"roundId":"round_1779466323088_8esnwonus","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775571541656_v84y814wp","characterId":"d8a326fa-9988-447d-8d82-e4e5a4ece511","_id":25448},{"id":1779462701534,"text":"你要是不喜欢，我明天就把家里翻一遍，所有打火机都扔了，好不好？","rawContent":"你要是不喜欢，我明天就把家里翻一遍，所有打火机都扔了，好不好？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"上午12:12","timestamp":1779466362417,"roundId":"round_1779466323088_8esnwonus","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775571541656_v84y814wp","characterId":"d8a326fa-9988-447d-8d82-e4e5a4ece511","_id":25449},{"id":1779462701535,"text":"他再次凑近，温热的唇贴在她的嘴角，带着些讨好的意味，轻轻啄吻。","rawContent":"[STATE]他再次凑近，温热的唇贴在她的嘴角，带着些讨好的意味，轻轻啄吻。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"上午12:12","timestamp":1779466366923,"roundId":"round_1779466323088_8esnwonus","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"type":"state","userId":"uid_1775571541656_v84y814wp","characterId":"d8a326fa-9988-447d-8d82-e4e5a4ece511","_id":25450},{"id":1779462701536,"text":"现在解释清楚了……老婆。","rawContent":"现在解释清楚了……老婆。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"上午12:12","timestamp":1779466369977,"roundId":"round_1779466323088_8esnwonus","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775571541656_v84y814wp","characterId":"d8a326fa-9988-447d-8d82-e4e5a4ece511","_id":25451},{"id":1779462701537,"text":"刚才说还要亲……还算数吗？","rawContent":"刚才说还要亲……还算数吗？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,